#X text 240 83 This object allows relative access to the array: the
input phase in the range 0\..1 is converted to the corresponding sample
index in the array. A value of 0 maps to the beginning of the array
and 1 to the end. If a list is received \, the conversion is applied
to each value and a list of indexes is output.;
